        skos:definition        "\"Radioactivity\" means the number of radioactive decays of a material per second. \"Radioactivity concentration\" means radioactivity per unit volume of the medium. \"As\" means the element \"arsenic\" and \"78As\" is the isotope \"arsenic-78\" with a half-life of 6.32e-02 days."@en;
        skos:notation          "SDN:P07::XNAN93IC";
