        skos:definition        "\"Radioactivity\" means the number of radioactive decays of a material per second. \"Radioactivity concentration\" means radioactivity per unit volume of the medium. \"Pd\" means the element \"palladium\" and \"109Pd\" is the isotope \"palladium-109\" with a half-life of 5.61e-01 days."@en;
