        skos:definition        "'product_of_X_and_Y' means X*Y. 'specific' means per unit mass. Specific humidity is the mass fraction of water vapor in (moist) air. 'omegaX' is used for brevity to mean 'lagrangian_tendency_of_air_pressure in standard names constructed as a combination of omega with some other quantity."@en;
        skos:notation          "SDN:P07::CFSN0398";
        skos:note              "deprecated"@en;
