        owl:versionInfo        "1";
        skos:altLabel          "";
        skos:definition        "The surface called \"surface\" means the lower boundary of the atmosphere. \"Content\" indicates a quantity per unit area. \"Radioactivity\" means the number of radioactive decays of a material per second. \"Ce\" means the element \"cerium\" and \"142Ce\" is the isotope \"cerium-142\" with a half-life of 1.82e+19 days."@en;
        skos:notation          "SDN:P07::DW35XFAS";
