        owl:versionInfo        "1";
        skos:altLabel          "";
        skos:definition        "The surface called \"surface\" means the lower boundary of the atmosphere. \"Content\" indicates a quantity per unit area. \"Radioactivity\" means the number of radioactive decays of a material per second. \"Np\" means the element \"neptunium\" and \"238Np\" is the isotope \"neptunium-238\" with a half-life of 2.10e+00 days."@en;
        skos:notation          "SDN:P07::OY29U2IY";
        skos:note              "accepted"@en;
