        skos:definition        "Mass concentration means mass per unit volume and is used in the construction mass_concentration_of_X_in_Y, where X is a material constituent of Y.  A chemical species denoted by X may be described by a single term such as 'nitrogen' or a phrase such as 'nox_expressed_as_nitrogen'. The chemical formula for nitrous oxide is N2O."@en;
        skos:notation          "SDN:P07::CF12N298";
        skos:note              "accepted"@en;
        skos:prefLabel         "mass_concentration_of_nitrous_oxide_in_air"@en;
