        skos:definition        "The construction \"atmosphere_moles_of_X\" means the total number of moles of X in the entire atmosphere, i.e. summed over the atmospheric column and over the entire globe. The chemical formula for methyl bromide is CH3Br. The IUPAC name for methyl bromide is bromomethane."@en;
        skos:notation          "SDN:P07::CF12S17";
        skos:note              "accepted"@en;
        skos:prefLabel         "atmosphere_moles_of_methyl_bromide"@en;
