        skos:definition        "\"Radioactivity\" means the number of radioactive decays of a material per second. \"Radioactivity concentration\" means radioactivity per unit volume of the medium. \"Cd\" means the element \"cadmium\" and \"117Cd\" is the isotope \"cadmium-117\" with a half-life of 1.08e-01 days."@en;
