        owl:versionInfo        "1";
        skos:altLabel          "";
        skos:definition        "The surface called \"surface\" means the lower boundary of the atmosphere. \"Content\" indicates a quantity per unit area. \"Radioactivity\" means the number of radioactive decays of a material per second. \"Pd\" means the element \"palladium\" and \"111mPd\" is the metastable state of the isotope \"palladium-111\" with a half-life of 2.29e-01 days."@en;
