        skos:definition        "\"Radioactivity\" means the number of radioactive decays of a material per second. \"Radioactivity concentration\" means radioactivity per unit volume of the medium. \"Pa\" means the element \"protactinium\" and \"233Pa\" is the isotope \"protactinium-233\" with a half-life of 2.70e+01 days."@en;
        skos:notation          "SDN:P07::QU3EZJPQ";
