        skos:definition        "\"tendency_of_X\" means derivative of X with respect to time.  The construction \"moles_of_X_in_atmosphere\" means the total number of moles of X contained in the entire atmosphere, i.e, summed over the atmospheric column and over the entire globe.    The chemical formula of CFC114 is CClF2CClF2.  The IUPAC name for CFC114 is 1,2-dichloro-1,1,2,2-tetrafluoro-ethane."@en;
        skos:notation          "SDN:P07::CFV8N93";
        skos:note              "deprecated"@en;
