        skos:definition        "The construction \"moles_of_X_in_atmosphere\" means the total number of moles of X contained in the entire atmosphere, i.e, summed over the atmospheric column and over the entire globe.  The chemical formula of CFC113 is CCl2FCClF2.  The IUPAC name for CFC113 is 1,1,2-trichloro-1,2,2-trifluoro-ethane."@en;
