        owl:versionInfo        "1";
        skos:altLabel          "";
        skos:definition        "The phrase \"integral_wrt_X_of_Y\" means int Y dX. The data variable should have an axis for X specifying the limits of the integral as bounds. The phrase \"wrt\" means \"with respect to\". \"Radioactivity\" means the number of radioactive decays of a material per second. \"Radioactivity concentration\" means radioactivity per unit volume of the medium. \"Eu\" means the element \"europium\" and \"157Eu\" is the isotope \"europium-157\" with a half-life of 6.32e-01 days."@en;
        skos:notation          "SDN:P07::2H9JEM9E";
