        skos:definition        "'product_of_X_and_Y' means X*Y. Air temperature is the bulk temperature of the air, not the surface (skin) temperature. 'omegaX' is used for brevity to mean 'lagrangian_tendency_of_air_pressure in standard names constructed as a combination of omega with some other quantity."@en;
