        skos:definition        "\"Radioactivity\" means the number of radioactive decays of a material per second. \"Radioactivity concentration\" means radioactivity per unit volume of the medium. \"In\" means the element \"indium\" and \"119In\" is the isotope \"indium-119\" with a half-life of 1.74e-03 days."@en;
