        skos:definition        "\"Radioactivity\" means the number of radioactive decays of a material per second. \"Radioactivity concentration\" means radioactivity per unit volume of the medium. \"Pu\" means the element \"plutonium\" and \"240Pu\" is the isotope \"plutonium-240\" with a half-life of 2.40e+06 days."@en;
        skos:notation          "SDN:P07::2JGDCI6Z";
