        skos:definition        "\"tendency_of_X\" means derivative of X with respect to time.  \"moles_of_X_in_troposphere\" means the total number of moles of X contained in the troposphere, i.e, summed over that part of the atmospheric column and over the entire globe.  The chemical formula of methyl bromide is CH3Br."@en;
        skos:notation          "SDN:P07::CFV8N110";
