        owl:versionInfo        "1";
        skos:altLabel          "";
        skos:definition        "The surface called \"surface\" means the lower boundary of the atmosphere. \"Content\" indicates a quantity per unit area. \"Radioactivity\" means the number of radioactive decays of a material per second. \"Tc\" means the element \"technetium\" and \"104Tc\" is the isotope \"technetium-104\" with a half-life of 1.25e-02 days."@en;
        skos:notation          "SDN:P07::QPKERA6T";
