        skos:definition        "\"Radioactivity\" means the number of radioactive decays of a material per second. \"Radioactivity concentration\" means radioactivity per unit volume of the medium. \"Ru\" means the element \"ruthenium\" and \"105Ru\" is the isotope \"ruthenium-105\" with a half-life of 1.85e-01 days."@en;
        skos:notation          "SDN:P07::US6VI1ET";
        skos:note              "accepted"@en;
