        skos:altLabel          "";
        skos:definition        "\"Radioactivity\" means the number of radioactive decays of a material per second. \"Radioactivity concentration\" means radioactivity per unit volume of the medium. \"Eu\" means the element \"europium\" and \"158Eu\" is the isotope \"europium-158\" with a half-life of 3.18e-02 days."@en;
        skos:notation          "SDN:P07::IEI182A2";
