        skos:altLabel          "";
        skos:definition        "\"Radioactivity\" means the number of radioactive decays of a material per second. \"Radioactivity concentration\" means radioactivity per unit volume of the medium. \"Ra\" means the element \"radium\" and \"223Ra\" is the isotope \"radium-223\" with a half-life of 1.14e+01 days."@en;
