        skos:definition        "\"Radioactivity\" means the number of radioactive decays of a material per second. \"Radioactivity concentration\" means radioactivity per unit volume of the medium. \"Mo\" means the element \"molybdenum\" and \"102Mo\" is the isotope \"molybdenum-102\" with a half-life of 7.71e-03 days."@en;
        skos:notation          "SDN:P07::KZSYKF2D";
