        owl:versionInfo        "1";
        skos:altLabel          "";
        skos:definition        "The phrase \"integral_wrt_X_of_Y\" means int Y dX. The data variable should have an axis for X specifying the limits of the integral as bounds. The phrase \"wrt\" means \"with respect to\". \"Radioactivity\" means the number of radioactive decays of a material per second. \"Radioactivity concentration\" means radioactivity per unit volume of the medium. \"Pa\" means the element \"protactinium\" and \"233Pa\" is the isotope \"protactinium-233\" with a half-life of 2.70e+01 days."@en;
        skos:notation          "SDN:P07::FL1I7BMK";
