        owl:versionInfo        "1";
        skos:altLabel          "";
        skos:definition        "The surface called \"surface\" means the lower boundary of the atmosphere. \"Content\" indicates a quantity per unit area. \"Radioactivity\" means the number of radioactive decays of a material per second. \"Pd\" means the element \"palladium\" and \"107mPd\" is the metastable state of the isotope \"palladium-107\" with a half-life of 2.47e-04 days."@en;
        skos:notation          "SDN:P07::F9CVXWYZ";
        skos:note              "accepted"@en;
