        skos:definition        "The surface called \"surface\" means the lower boundary of the atmosphere. \"Content\" indicates a quantity per unit area. \"Radioactivity\" means the number of radioactive decays of a material per second. \"Rh\" means the element \"rhodium\" and \"106mRh\" is the metastable state of the isotope \"rhodium-106\" with a half-life of 9.09e-02 days."@en;
