        skos:definition        "The surface called \"surface\" means the lower boundary of the atmosphere. \"Content\" indicates a quantity per unit area. \"Radioactivity\" means the number of radioactive decays of a material per second. \"Tc\" means the element \"technetium\" and \"101Tc\" is the isotope \"technetium-101\" with a half-life of 9.86e-03 days."@en;
