        skos:definition        "The phrase \"square_of_X\" means X*X. Frequency is the number of oscillations of a wave per unit time. Brunt-Vaisala frequency is also sometimes called \"buoyancy frequency\" and is a measure of the vertical stratification of the medium."@en;
