        owl:versionInfo        "1";
        skos:altLabel          "";
        skos:definition        "The surface called \"surface\" means the lower boundary of the atmosphere. \"Content\" indicates a quantity per unit area. \"Radioactivity\" means the number of radioactive decays of a material per second. \"As\" means the element \"arsenic\" and \"78As\" is the isotope \"arsenic-78\" with a half-life of 6.32e-02 days."@en;
        skos:notation          "SDN:P07::7QH58ZUH";
        skos:note              "accepted"@en;
