        skos:definition        "The surface called \"surface\" means the lower boundary of the atmosphere. \"Content\" indicates a quantity per unit area. \"Radioactivity\" means the number of radioactive decays of a material per second. \"Pm\" means the element \"promethium\" and \"152Pm\" is the isotope \"promethium-152\" with a half-life of 2.84e-03 days."@en;
        skos:notation          "SDN:P07::D22YYKEJ";
