        owl:versionInfo        "1";
        skos:altLabel          "";
        skos:definition        "The surface called \"surface\" means the lower boundary of the atmosphere. \"Content\" indicates a quantity per unit area. \"Radioactivity\" means the number of radioactive decays of a material per second. \"Eu\" means the element \"europium\" and \"156Eu\" is the isotope \"europium-156\" with a half-life of 1.52e+01 days."@en;
