        skos:definition        "\"tendency_of_X\" means derivative of X with respect to time.  \"moles_of_X_in_middle_atmosphere\" means the total number of moles of X contained in the troposphere and stratosphere, i.e, summed over that part of the atmospheric column and over the entire globe.  The chemical formula of carbon monoxide is CO."@en;
