        owl:versionInfo        "1";
        skos:altLabel          "";
        skos:definition        "\"Radioactivity\" means the number of radioactive decays of a material per second. \"Radioactivity concentration\" means radioactivity per unit volume of the medium. \"Ag\" means the element \"silver\" and \"113mAg\" is the metastable state of the isotope \"silver-113\" with a half-life of 7.64e-04 days."@en;
        skos:notation          "SDN:P07::N5HDC6DX";
