        skos:definition        "\"Northward\" indicates a vector component which is positive when directed northward (negative southward). The \"Transformed Eulerian Mean\" refers to a formulation of the mean equations which incorporates some eddy terms into the definition of the mean, described in Andrews et al (1987): Middle Atmospheric Dynamics. Academic Press."@en;
