        skos:definition        "The surface called \"surface\" means the lower boundary of the atmosphere. \"Content\" indicates a quantity per unit area. \"Radioactivity\" means the number of radioactive decays of a material per second. \"Pd\" means the element \"palladium\" and \"109Pd\" is the isotope \"palladium-109\" with a half-life of 5.61e-01 days."@en;
        skos:notation          "SDN:P07::52IUWBLO";
