        skos:definition        "\"Radioactivity\" means the number of radioactive decays of a material per second. \"Radioactivity concentration\" means radioactivity per unit volume of the medium. \"Rh\" means the element \"rhodium\" and \"103mRh\" is the metastable state of the isotope \"rhodium-103\" with a half-life of 3.89e-02 days."@en;
        skos:notation          "SDN:P07::PUHIKNHG";
        skos:note              "accepted"@en;
