        skos:definition        "The surface called \"surface\" means the lower boundary of the atmosphere. \"Content\" indicates a quantity per unit area. \"Radioactivity\" means the number of radioactive decays of a material per second. \"Po\" means the element \"polonium\" and \"218Po\" is the isotope \"polonium-218\" with a half-life of 2.12e-03 days."@en;
