        skos:definition        "The specification of a physical process by the phrase due_to_process means that the quantity named is a single term in a sum of terms which together compose the general quantity named by omitting the phrase. 'tendency_of_X' means derivative of X with respect to time. Air temperature is the bulk temperature of the air, not the surface (skin) temperature."@en;
        skos:notation          "SDN:P07::CFSN0207";
        skos:note              "deprecated"@en;
        skos:prefLabel         "tendency_of_air_temperature_due_to_large_scale_precipitation"@en;
